nt release that was healthy in production. us-east, us-west and eu-west are all now on v2.3.0 instead of v2.3.1. The error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api. It says v2.3.1 failed health checks, describes the rollback and confirms the service recovered.\n- **Follow-up:** The release candidate for v2.3.1 also failed in staging, but it was still deployed to production. The incident asks for the root cause of the failure and why it was promoted anyway.", "type": "text"}]}]}